          "solution": [{ "d": 1, "f": "¬p", "r": "Hyp" }, { "d": 1, "f": "⊥", "r": "¬E", "c": "2, 1" }, { "d": 0, "f": "p", "r": "RA", "c": "2-3" }],
          "explanation": "On suppose ¬p, on obtient une contradiction avec ¬¬p, donc p par l'absurde."
